oṃ namo vighnahantre ||


śrī (*) na (*) ja (*) u (*) ca ||


[bhagavañśrotumicchāmi māhātmyaṃ yacchukasya ca |
parasparaṃ tu saṃvādaṃ vyāsasya ca śukasya ca] || 1 || 

yatrāśramapade ramye saṃvādaḥ sumahānabhūt |
pituḥ putreṇa sahayastaṃ me brūhi mahāmane || 2 ||

śṛṇuṣvāvahito rājanyathā teṣāṃ mahātmanām |
saṃvādamimamaśrauṣamadbhutalo maharṣaṇam || 3 ||

tatrāśramapaderamye siddhagandharva sevite |
trailokya viśrute deśe nānā ṛṣi nisevite || 4 ||

nānādrumalatākīrṇe nānāpuṣpo paśobhite |
hradaiśca vividhākāraistoyapūrṇairmanoramaiḥ || 5 ||

haṃsakaraṇḍa vā kīrṇaiścakra vā kopaśobhitaiḥ |
sunādairmadhuraiḥ śabdairhuṅkāraiḥ sumanoramaiḥ || 6 ||

pakṣibhirvividhākāraiḥ padmaiśca bhramarā kulaiḥ |
sevyamāne tu satataṃ brāhmaṇairmuni puṅgavaiḥ || 7 ||

vedadhvaniḥ śruyate ca juhvatāmagni hotṛṇām |
tatrāsramapaderamye tiṣṭhate bhagavānnṛpa || 8 ||

parāśara sutovyāso vedavyāso mahāmuniḥ |
<p. 181a> tasya putro mahāyogī śukonāmamahātmanām || 9 ||

samastaśāstravinnityaṃ pitaraṃ paripṛṣṭavān |
upasaṅgṛhya caraṇā vidaṃ vacanamabravīt || 10 ||

rāgadveṣau parityajya śrūyatāṃ tātabhāṣitam |
saṃsāre vividhā dṛṣṭā mahāmohamahārṇave || 11 ||

mātaraḥ pitaraścaiva bāndhavaśca sahasraśaḥ |
bhūṣāṇī yāni karmāṇi yauvanāni dhanāni ca || 12 ||

āgataśca gataścaiva nānā tiryakta(?) yoniṣu |
bhrāmyamāṇo smyahaṃ tatra yatra vaddhaḥ paśuryathā || 13 ||

prāptohaṃ mānuṣaṃ lokaṃ karmabhūmiṃ sudurlabhām |
dharmyaṃ svargasya sopānaṃ mayālabdhaṃ purātanam || 14 ||

<p. 181b> pūrvamāsā ṛtaṃ(?) caiva mandiraṃ gaṇasevitam |
nakṣattraistārakaiścaiva dīpyamānaṃ samantataḥ || 15 ||

bhogāstatra mayā bhuktāḥ paramāye vicintitāḥ |
paribhraṣṭasubhaścāhaṃ kṣīṇapuṇya iva grahaḥ || 16 ||

krimikīṭapataṅgeṣu tiryagyoni śateṣu ca |
aṇḍajāḥ svedajāścaiva kledajā bhedajāstathā || 17 ||

udbhijāmalajāścaitathāye cānya yonijāḥ |
siṃhavyāghravarāhādi mārjārādi śateṣvapi || 18 ||

kīṭohaṃ daśavarṣāṇi pataṅgohaṃ caturdaśa |
aṇḍajātistathā caiva śataṃ varṣāṇi vai punaḥ || 19 ||

siṃhohaṃ daśavarṣāṇi vyāghraḥ pañcadaśāpi ca |
<p. 182a> sūkaraḥ pañcavarṣāṇi ṛkṣaḥ pañcadaśāpyaham || 20 ||

viṃśadvarṣāṇi gartāṭo (*)(?) laśca caturdaśa |
triṃśadvarṣāṇi sarpohaṃ jambukatve trayodaśa || 21 ||

hastī saptati varṣāṇi daśavarṣāṇi gardabhaḥ |
haṃsohaṃ saptavarṣāṇi daśavarṣāṇi cātakaḥ || 22 ||

gṛddhraḥ pañcadaśāvyāni kākatve daśavārṣike |
sthāvaratve gataścāhaṃ pañcavarṣaśatānyapi || 23 ||

evaṃ jāti sahasrāṇi bhrāmyamāṇena nityaśaḥ |
pakṣitvepi mayātāta kṣudhādṛṣṭāti dāruṇā || 24 ||

tiryakṣe kaṇḍulā nityaṃ sthāvaratve tuṣāratā |
evaṃ varṣasahasrāṇi tvanu bhūtāni vai mayā || 25 ||

<p. 182b> jātīḥ smarāmitrāḥ sarvā hyanu bhūtāssahasrāṇi |
ekaikāṃ ca viśeṣena smaramāṇo layaṃ gataḥ || 26 ||

tadahaṃ bhītabhītosmi saṃsārārṇavadustare |
narakeṣu ca ghoreṣu paśyamānaḥ punaḥ punaḥ || 27 ||

bhinnohaṃ vividhaiśśāstraryamadūtaiḥ sudārujaiḥ |
saṃsārārṇava bhītosmi pañcabhūtairadhiṣṭitāḥ || 28 ||

idaṃ kāmamayaṃ sarvaṃ viṣayāḥ pañcamendriyāḥ |
kimanena kariṣyāmi jarāmaraṇabhītitaḥ || 29 ||

tasyai tadvacanaṃ śrutvā śukasya sa mahātmanaḥ |
asrupūrṇo mahāyogī hyāsanāt patito bhuvi || 30 ||

parāśara suto vyāso vedavyāso mahāmuniḥ |
<p. 183a> vaiṣṇavī (* *)(?) māśritya putrasnehena mohitaḥ || 31 ||

kathaṃ putra parityajya mātaraṃ pitaraṃ tathā |
bāndhavāṃścaiva mitrāṇi suhṛtsaṃbandhinastathā || 32 ||

prasthāne gantukāmosti nūnaṃ hi tava putraka |
sarvathā nāsti me kṛtyaṃ bhāryāyā jīvitena ca || 33 ||

mātā pitṛ sahasrāṇi putradāra śatāni ca |
saṃsāre hyanu bhūtāni kasya te kasya vā vayam || 34 ||

ahaṃtā tatva yā jāto mayājātāssahasraśaḥ |
satenāpi suto jātaḥ paśyamāyāṃ vijṛmbhitam || 35 ||

agastya ṛṣyaśṛṅgaśca bhṛgurāṅgirasastathā |
tepi mṛtyuvaśaṃ yātā na kāryaṃ jīvitena me || 25 ||

<p. 183b> parāśvaro mahātmā vai mārkāṇḍeyo mahāmuniḥ |
tepi mṛtyu vaśaṃ yātā na kāryaṃ jīvitena me || 26 ||

vasiṣṭo gautamaśaiva viśvāmitrastathaiva ca |
tepi mṛtyuvaśaṃ yātā na kāryaṃ jīvitena me || 27 ||

durvāsā lomaharṣaśca śāṇḍilyaśca punarvasuḥ |
tepi mṛtyuvasyaṃ(?) yātā nakāryaṃ jīvitena me || 28 ||

saumyaḥ saṃvartakaścaiva gārgikātyāyanastathā |
tepi mṛtyuvaśaṃ yātā na kāryaṃ jīvitena me || 29 ||

daśajyotiśśatajyotissahasrajyotirva ca |
tepi mṛtyuvaśaṃ vātā na kāryaṃ jīvitena me || 30 ||

ūrdhvabāhuśca mārkaṇḍo vāyubhakṣombubhojanaḥ |
<p. 184a> ete cānye ca bahavo mṛtyugocaramāgatāḥ || 31 ||

hiraṇyakaśipyaścaiva rāvaṇaścendrajittathā |
sundopasundāvasurau kālanemirmahābalaḥ || 32 ||

nīlaśca jāmbhavāṃścaiva sugrīvo gandhamādanaḥ |
subāhuśca mahāteja vānarā evamādayaḥ || 33 ||

devāśca rākṣasāścaiva kumbhakarṇoti vīryavān |
akṣo mahodaraścaiva devāntaka narāntakau || 34 ||

kharaśudūṣaṇaścaiva sarve mṛtyuvaśaṃ gatāḥ |
yaśca duryodhano rājā pārtho bhīṣmo yudhiṣṭhiraḥ || 35 ||

indraśca dhanadaścaiva yamaloke tathāntakaḥ |
evamādi mānuṣyāṇāmṛṣīṇāṃ bhāvitātmanām || 36 ||

<p. 184b> mriyate sarvajantūnāṃ bhūtagrāmaścaturvidhaḥ |
kiṃ tvaṃ jānīhi hetāta sarve yāsyanti vai kṣayam || 37 ||

brahmādi stambha paryantamimelokāścarācarāḥ |
nirvedo me samutpannaḥ prasthāne prasthitosmyaham || 38 ||

saṃsārārṇava bhītosmi gantukāmo na saṃśayaḥ |
ahaṃ tatra gamiṣyāmi yatra tvaṃ gantumicchasi |
manorathaśataiḥ putra cintitosi mayā vṛthā || 40 ||

āśāpāśanibaddhasya cāśrayo me bhaviṣyati ||

na kasya cidahaṃ putro na ca kaścit pitā mama |
sahasreṣu hyahaṃ jāto janitāśca mahasraśaḥ || 42 ||

jane nāpi jano jāto jano jānayate janān |
<p. 185a>  janaṃ śocati cātmā vai svātmānaṃ śocate janaḥ || 43 ||

putrastvahaṃ tvayā jāto mayā jāḍyāḥ sahasraśaḥ |
sutenāpi sutojātaḥ paśyamāyā vimohitān || 44 ||

carācaraṃ jagatsarvaṃ sa devāsuramānavam |
vṛtaṃ devena sūkṣmeṇa ceśvareṇa mahātmanā || 45 ||

sṛṣṭaṃ bhagavatā tena hariṇālokadhāriṇā |
kena varṇena vai śakyaṃ jñātuṃ jñānena sarvadā || 46 ||

rajāmaraṇabhītohaṃ janme janme punaḥ punaḥ |
kintutātanaparyāptaṃ yanmāṃ mohayase punaḥ || 47 ||

vasatā garbhavāmeṣu yanmayā cintitaṃ mahat |
narakaṃ tanmayātītaṃ jñānaṃ labdhaṃ sudurlabham || 48 ||

<p. 185b> sītamauṣṇyaṃ kṣudhātṛṣṇā garbhavāseṣu dāruṇā |
garbhavāsādṛte tātanānyatkaṣvataraṃ bhayam || 49 ||

indriyāṇāṃ calatvāśca strīṇāṃ ca ṛtulālanāt |
rajoretasyahaṃjātarkiṃ tatra bhavatā kṛtam || 50 ||

na kasya cidahaṃ putro na ca jātosmi kena cit |
indriyāṇāṃ calatvena baddhohaṃ pūrvakarmabhiḥ || 51 ||

yadi putraḥ piturnāśe pitā vā putra nāśane |
prāṇatyāgaṃ ca kurute paśya māyā vijṛmbhitam || 52 ||

gītārthe na purādiṣṭaṃ yadi janma na vidyate |
vipannasya punarjanma deginosya(?) na vidyate || 53 ||

<p. 186a> bhāratepi tvayā tāta pūrvaṃ dṛṣṭamanāgatam |
traikālyadarśībhūtvāpi kiṃ mūḍha iva tapyase || 54 ||

yathāmuṣṭibhirākāśaṃ tuṣānāṃ khaṇḍanaṃ yathā |
tatvayā bhārate śāstre gītārthe nāvadhāritam || 55 ||

kasya mātā pitā kasya kasya bandhurmahāmune |
vibhramaśca smṛti bhraṃśastena muhyanti jantavaḥ || 56 ||

ahamekonamekaścinnāhamanyasya kasyacit |
nāhaṃ paśyāmi yasyāha nāsau paśyati yo mama || 57 ||

nairaṃ(?)suhṛtsamupayāti na bandhu vargo nārthaḥ prayatnanicito na suto na bhāryā |
yasmin kṣaṇe priya śatāni vihāya puṃsaḥ prāṇāḥ svakarmaphalapathyadhanāḥ prayānti || 58 ||

<p. 186b> ahobhāryā aho putrā aho ātmā aho sukham |
aho mātā aho bhrātā paśyamāyā vimohitam || 59 ||

dharmo mātā pitā caiva dharmo bandhurmahāmune |
mātaro vividhā dṛṣṭā pītā nānā vidhāḥstanāḥ || 60 ||

saṃsārekatinātītāḥ pitaraśca pṛthak pṛthak |
evaṃ saṃsaramaṇena gatirlabdhā mayepsitā || 61 ||

prasādāddevadevasya ceśvarasya mahātmanaḥ |
yena saṃvatsaro dṛṣṭassakṛtkartā ca sevitā || 62 ||

tena sarvamidaṃ dṛṣṭaṃ punarāvartate jagat |
ekasārtha prayātānāṃ sarveṣāṃ tatra gāminām || 63 ||

yadyekastvaritaṃ yāti tatrakāparidevanā |
ekavṛkṣe yathārātrau nānā pakṣi samāgamaḥ || 64 ||

<p. 187a> prātardaśadiśo yānti tadvadbhūtasamāgamaḥ || 65 ||

yauvanaṃ jarayāgrastamārogyaṃ vyādhibhirhatam |
mṛtyurgrasati bhūtāni kiṃ dhīra iva bhāṣase || 66 ||

yathākāṣṭaṃ ca kāṣṭaṃ ca samīyātāṃ mahodadhau |
sametya ca vyatītāyāṃ tadvadbhūta samāgamaḥ || 67 ||

icchanti kecinnarakeṣu vāsaṃ te (*)(?) nti naivodaradeśavāsam |
śreyo hi tasmānnarakaṃ viśiṣṭaṃ na garbhavāsātparamaṃ hi duḥkham || 68 ||

etāni duḥkhāni bahunilokesaṃ smṛtyatāvannarakaṃ viśiṣṭam |
yoni praveśe paramaṃ hi duḥkhaṃ viṇmutraretaḥ pratimaṃ samagram || 69 ||

pravrajāmi hyahaṃtāta na nityaṃ khalu jīvitam |
<p. 187b> garbhanāsabhayodvigro bhītosmi maraṇādapi || 70 ||

gṛhāśramātparodharmo vanasthānāṃ na vidyate |
pālayanti narānsarvānguru(?)devārcane ratāḥ || 71 ||

aśāśvato gṛhārambho duḥkhaṃ saṃsārabandhanam |
aho prasphuritā mūḍhā nirguṇāguṇamāśritāḥ || 72 ||


śrī sa vā 


tapo vaneṣu ye jātāstatraiva nidhanaṃ gatā |
teṣāmalpataro dharmaḥ kāmabhogamajānabhām || 73 ||

idaṃ tarkeṇa bandhāya maṭhaprākāratoraṇam |
narāṇāṃ yatra hūyante yauvanāni dhanāni ca || 74 ||

anekāni sahasrāṇi kaumāravratadhāriṇām |
<p. 188a> divaṃgatāni dṛśyante hyakṛtvā kulapaddhatim || 75 ||

gṛhasthānācca saṃbhūtā dṛśyante hyāśrasāstrayaḥ |
bhi (*)(?)ryaścaiva jīvanti tasmācchreṣṭo gṛhāśramī || 76 ||

gṛhastha eva yajate gṛhasthastapate tapaḥ |
caturṇāmapi varṇānāṃ gṛhasthastu viśiṣyate || 77 ||

yathā mātaramāśritya sarve jīvanti jantavaḥ |
evaṃ gṛhasthamāśritya sarve tiṣṭhanti bhikṣukāḥ || 78 ||

svāmino hyupakārāya bhṛtyā jīvanti nityaśaḥ |
bhṛtyānāṃ hi pradhānatvāt svāmi tatphalamaśnute || 79 ||

sūryakhadyotayoryamyaham || 100 ||

<p. 188b> dharmaṃ ca rathamādharmaṃ satyaṃ vadatamānṛtam |
nāndhakāre praveṣṭavyaṃ tasmājjāgrata jāgrata || 101 ||

mānuṣyaṃ durlabhaṃ prāpya taḍidbilasito mama |
paramaṃ ca samāsādya kimanyat sukṛtaṃ kṛtam || 2 ||

śārīreṇa tu duḥkhena pīḍyante mānasena ca |
yadaśchrasantitaccitraṃ samastāḥ prāṇino bhuvi || 3 ||

samāgarātvaparyantā sa śailavanakānanā |
tāvadya ca na paśyāmi yairbhuṅke yaṃ vasundharā || 4 ||

purandarasahasrāṇi cakravarti satāni ca |
nirvāpitāni kālena pradīpā iva vāyunā || 5 ||

priyasaṅgamalobhena janaḥ śokena badhyate |
camarī vālake naiva tatraiva nidhanaṃ gatā || 6 ||


