<p. 191a> ajñāne nātha rāgeṇa lobhena ca vaśī kṛtaḥ |
saṅghairbahubhinā krāntastena svargaṃ na gacchati || 7 ||

arthaṃ dhigasta bahuvairakaraṃ narāṇāṃ rājyaṃ dhigastu bhayadaṃ bahu cintanīyam |
svargaṃ dhiṭhastu(?) punarāgamana pravṛttiṃ dhigdhikkarīramiharogasamāśrayaṃ ca || 8 ||

bījaṃ pitā kṣetra mahījanitrī varṣāṇi karmāṇi śubhāśubhāni |
jīvāṃstasasya pratimānhi loke pakvāna pakvāṃścalunāti kālaḥ || 9 ||

gṛhe tvarthān parityajya śmaśāne mitrabhāndhavān |
nagnāṅgoriktahastaśca prayāti muṣito yathā || 10 ||

bāla eva careddharmamanityaṃ (*)(?)la jīvitam |
<p. 191b> phalānāmiva pakvānāṃ śaśvatpatanato bhayam || 11 ||

paśyadharmasya māhātmyaṃ kriyamāṇasya nityaśaḥ |
ātmanaḥ kurute śreyo lokasya bhavati priyaḥ || 12 ||

ni (*)(?) kā devayadduḥkhaṃ mayā prāptasudāruṇam |
tenāsamivasaṃlipto bahukālaṃ (*) mantataḥ || 13 ||

ekaviṃśati saṅkhyāṃtā narakāḥ śāstra tatparaiḥ |
garbhavāsasamīpe tu kalāṃ nāhanti ṣoḍaśīm || 14 ||

tva (*)(?) vajanitāḥ putrā putraiśca paripālitāḥ |
aparairjanitāścānye paśyasaṃsāravibhramam || 15 ||

tapo mama pitānityaṃ dharmaścaiva pitāmahaḥ |
prapitāmahatātyāge gatirmāheśvarī tanuḥ || 16 ||

<p. 192a> mānuṣatve tathānyonyaṃ janme janme punaḥ punaḥ |
gatistātanasandeho yatra janma na vidyate || 17 ||

vasantakāle kusumā kulākule vanāntare puṣparasāntarāntare |
stanāntaraṃ yaḥ puruṣo na sevate hatāntaraṃ tasya narasya jīvitam || 18 ||

jñānāntaraṃ mokṣapadāntarāntaraṃ dharmāntaraṃ yogapadāntarāntaram |
dhyānāntaraṃ yaḥ puruṣo na sevate matāntaraṃ nyasya narasya jīvitam || 19 ||

lavaṅgakallolakavāsitādharaṃ tāmbūlaraktauṣṭhavibhūṣitāntaram |
mukhāntaraṃ yaḥ puruṣonusevate mithyāntaraṃ tasya narasya jīvi || 20 ||


